          "media": {
            "duration": 1473,
            "fileSize": 23831113
          },
          "description": "The Soundtrekkers head to the Indian Ocean to record the loud sound the Snapping Shrimp’s claws make, but after recording a sample, they suddenly overhear something distressing on their mic. It’s the horrible sea bully Sea Cucumber Jones, an oversized lug who sports a sea cucumber costume, hurling insults at a tiny shrimp. “Hey you little shrimp!” “Get back here, shrimp!” “What are you shrimp? Chicken??” When his bullying spreads to other small marine life, the Soundtrekkers consult the Seven Cs Solver app, which suggests COMPASSION as a way to help. In the end, the crew learns that when Sea Cucumber Jones was just a junior villain, he too was a victim of bullying. All the blundering bad guy really needs is a bit of tender love and attention in order to cut out the shenanigans!",
